{"id":"636210","name":"琥珀核桃","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/636210/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"核桃仁","amount":"500克"},{"name":"冰糖","amount":"160克"},{"name":"蜂蜜","amount":"50克"},{"name":"熟白芝麻","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用碱","amount":"一小勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好核桃仁，清洗干净。","img":"images/636210/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"凉水上锅，加食用碱，煮5分钟左右。","img":"images/636210/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"去除苦涩味。","img":"images/636210/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"过凉水，清洗干净。","img":"images/636210/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再凉水上锅，清水煮3分钟左右，再次去除苦涩味。","img":"images/636210/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出，过凉水，清洗干净，多洗几遍，沥干水分。","img":"images/636210/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"起锅，加60克水。","img":"images/636210/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"克冰糖。","img":"images/636210/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"克蜂蜜，熬糖。","img":"images/636210/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"有密集的小泡泡时。","img":"images/636210/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"下入核桃仁，翻拌均匀，每块核桃仁都裹上糖浆，盛出待用。","img":"images/636210/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"起锅加稍宽的油。","img":"images/636210/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"凉油，下入裹好糖浆的核桃仁，全程小火炸12分钟左右。","img":"images/636210/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"捞出，沥干油。","img":"images/636210/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加熟的白芝麻，翻拌均匀，晾凉即可食用。","img":"images/636210/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/636210/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/636210/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/636210/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}